<comment>How do you feel about each activity? Choose Dislike, Skip, or Like for every idea.</comment>
<row label="r1">A sunrise walk</row>
<row label="r2">Trying a new recipe</row>
<row label="r3">An afternoon at a museum</row>
<row label="r4">A picnic in the park</row>
<col label="c1" value="1">Dislike</col><col label="c2" value="2">Skip</col><col label="c3" value="3">Like</col>
